  "additional_concerns": [
    "The representation is an unsupported-profile error, not inspectable executable logic. It establishes neither preservation nor a substantive omission, conflict, extra restriction or permission.",
    "The independent SFC designation route must remain distinct from the exposure threshold. Footnote 7 addresses exposure below 50%; risk factors inform discretionary designation and do not themselves establish an operative designation.",
    "The indirect-exposure examples are non-exhaustive. Instrument names and the CLO definition do not establish full-value attribution, look-through methodology, valuation timing or double-counting treatment.",
    "Unknown exposure or designation evidence must not silently become a negative fact. The question's false result must remain limited to its stated evidentiary and temporal scope.",
    "The separate 15% investment limit, sales suitability requirements, review completion and document-update timing supply no additional classification prerequisite or permission to delay classification.",
    "The source does not resolve persistence after exposure declines, designation expiry or temporary threshold crossings.",
    "The supplied missing dependency IDs lack identifying metadata; none can reliably be assigned to a named external authority.",
    "For claim.497fdb6622cd3d404911cd15, the review duty alone is outside the question, while its express no-exemption inference bears on scope. The proposal treats the combined claim as relevant without making review completion a classification condition; the duty-only reading remains a narrower alternative."
